Added :func:`icalendar.compose_free_busy`, which synthesizes the ``FREEBUSY`` periods of several ``VFREEBUSY`` components into a non-overlapping timeline for a UTC query window. Overlaps are resolved with a caller given ``FBTYPE`` priority, every segment keeps the sources that explain it, uncovered time is marked as unknown instead of free, and the result can be written back as a standard ``VFREEBUSY`` component.
